  "description": "Habaek, the god of water who rules over water, comes to the human world to find his reincarnated bride, So-ah. Yoon So-ah, an 18-year-old high school student in South Korea. Suddenly, a man calling himself the water god Habaek appears and claims that she is his bride. \n\n\" I don’t even have a boyfriend, let alone a marriage, and yet I am a married woman and the mother of three daughters?! \"\n\nAfter meeting Habaek, So-ah’s ordinary life begins to change dramatically.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68102414), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%ED%95%98%EB%B0%B1%EC%9D%98-%EC%8B%A0%EB%B6%80-2/4680)",
